  "response_text": "I can assist you with a wide variety of tasks, including:\n\n### **Tasks I Can Help With:**\n1. **Email Management**:\n   - Send, delete, search, and organize emails.\n   - Retrieve unread, sent, received, or draft emails.\n   - Search contacts by name or email.\n   \n2. **Calendar Management**:\n   - Schedule, reschedule, or cancel calendar events.\n   - Add participants to events.\n   - Search or retrieve events for specific days.\n   \n3. **File Management**:\n   - Create, delete, search, or list files in your cloud drive.\n   - Append content to existing files.\n   - Share files with others and manage permissions.\n   - Work with various file types (see below).\n\n4. **General Assistance**:\n   - Provide reminders or check the current date.\n   - Help with organizing and planning tasks.\n\n---\n\n### **Items in Your Workspace (Most Recent First):**\nTo list the most recent items (such as emails, files, or events), I’ll need to check your workspace. Would you like me to retrieve:\n- Recent emails (unread, sent, or received)?\n- Recent calendar events?\n- Recent files in your cloud drive?\n\nLet me know which category you’d like me to prioritize, and I’ll fetch the details for you.\n\n---\n\n### **File Types I Can Work With:**\nI can handle a variety of file types, including but not limited to:\n- **Text files** (`.txt`, `.md`, `.log`, etc.)\n- **Documents** (`.doc`, `.docx`, `.pdf`, `.rtf`, etc.)\n- **Spreadsheets** (`.xls`, `.xlsx`, `.csv`, etc.)\n- **Presentations** (`.ppt`, `.pptx`, etc.)\n- **Code files** (`.py`, `.js`, `.html`, `.css`, `.json`, etc.)\n- **Configuration files** (`.yaml`, `.yml`, `.ini`, `.conf`, etc.)\n- **Archives** (`.zip`, `.tar.gz`, etc., though I can’t extract or compress them).\n\nIf you have specific file types you’d like help with, let me know! \n\nWould you like me to fetch any particular items for you now?",
